flowchart TD
    A[Developer edits roles.json] --> B[Create Pull Request]
    B --> C[GitHub Actions validation]
    C --> D[JSON validation]
    C --> E[Terraform fmt and validate]
    D --> F{Validation passed?}
    E --> F
    F -- No --> G[Fix configuration]
    G --> B
    F -- Yes --> H[Terraform plan with read-only GCP identity]
    H --> I[Plan summary and PR comment]
    I --> J[Reviewer approval and merge]
    J --> K[Push to main]
    K --> L[GitHub production environment approval]
    L --> M[WIF authentication with apply identity]
    M --> N[Fresh Terraform plan from merged main]
    N --> O[Terraform apply]
    O --> P[GCP Project IAM bindings]
    Q[(GCS remote Terraform state)] --- H
    Q --- N
    Q --- O
